#: ../../../userguide/index.rst:3
msgid "Building and Distributing Packages with Setuptools"
msgstr "使用 Setuptools 建置並散佈軟體包"

#: ../../../userguide/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"The first step towards sharing a Python library or program is to build a "
"distribution package [#package-overload]_. This includes adding a set of "
"additional files containing metadata and configuration to not only instruct "
"``setuptools`` on how the distribution should be built but also to help "
"installer (such as :pypi:`pip`) during the installation process."
msgstr ""
"分享 Python 程式庫或程式的第一步，是建立一個散佈包 [#package-overload]_ 。這"
"包括加入一組包含中繼資料和組態的額外檔案，不僅用來指示 ``setuptools`` 如何建"
"置散佈包，也能在安裝過程中協助安裝工具（例如 :pypi:`pip`）。"

#: ../../../userguide/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"This document contains information to help Python developers through this "
"process. Please check the :doc:`/userguide/quickstart` for an overview of "
"the workflow."
msgstr ""
"本文件包含協助 Python 開發者完成此過程的資訊。請查閱\\ :doc:`/userguide/"
"quickstart`\\ 以了解工作流程的概覽。"

#: ../../../userguide/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Also note that ``setuptools`` is what is known in the community as :pep:"
"`build backend <517#terminology-and-goals>`, user facing interfaces are "
"provided by tools such as :pypi:`pip` and :pypi:`build`. To use "
"``setuptools``, one must explicitly create a ``pyproject.toml`` file as "
"described :doc:`/build_meta`."
msgstr ""
"另外請注意，``setuptools`` 在社群中被稱為\\ :pep:`建置後端 <517#terminology-"
"and-goals>`\\ ，使用者面對的介面則由 :pypi:`pip` 和 :pypi:`build` 等工具提"
"供。若要使用 ``setuptools``，必須按照 :doc:`/build_meta` 所述的方式，明確建立"
"一個 ``pyproject.toml`` 檔案。"

