#: ../../../userguide/index.rst:46
msgid ""
"A :term:`Distribution Package` is also referred in the Python community "
"simply as \"package\" Unfortunately, this jargon might be a bit confusing "
"for new users because the term package can also to refer any :term:"
"`directory <package>` (or sub directory) used to organize :term:`modules "
"<module>` and auxiliary files."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 社群中，\\ :term:`散佈包（Distribution Package） <Distribution "
"Package>`\\ 也常簡稱為「軟體包（package）」。不幸的是，這個術語對新手來說可能"
"有點困惑，因為「軟體包」一詞也可以指用於組織\\ :term:`模組 <module>`\\ 和輔助"
"檔案的任何\\ :term:`目錄（directory） <package>`\\ （或子目錄）。"
